WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:06,280
I rely on Xiazi to follow me and still use you.

2
00:00:06,280 --> 00:00:07,320
All come in

3
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:10,220
You say no now

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:13,430
Without Lai Xiazi following you, you would still be so arrogant

5
00:00:13,430 --> 00:00:15,450
Lord Sword Seymoko

6
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:21,550
How can a person be so talented, Brother Hao?

7
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:23,030
Let’s just say we got lost.

8
00:00:23,030 --> 00:00:25,270
Those aliens will believe it, right? I listen to the palace.

9
00:00:25,270 --> 00:00:27,990
Foreign races are all stupid, Xiao Shuangjun, let’s fight later

10
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:29,310
You cover me, Qi Xiaohei goes first

11
00:00:29,310 --> 00:00:30,310
If I go back alive

12
00:00:30,310 --> 00:00:36,960
I gave you three marbles, what should the president do?

13
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:38,260
But you sir

14
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:43,900
Kill them for me

15
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,040
So arrogant

16
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:47,520
It looks like Huazou or Laixiazi are not far away

17
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,120
The crisis in Longmu City can be solved

18
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:50,080
As expected of me
